# The cv release the site is built from, and the sha256 of its two artefacts.
#
# The trust anchor is the two digests below, in this repository. A release tag
# is not immutable: a moved tag or a replaced asset would change the build
# silently, so task content:build refuses any artefact whose sha256 differs from
# the pin, and refuses an empty digest next to a set tag.
#
# CV_RELEASE_TAG must be a version tag, never a branch or "latest". The files
# are downloaded from
# https://github.com/ostendorf-cloud/cv/releases/download/<tag>/cv.de.json and
# cv.en.json.
#
# To bump, by hand: download both assets of the new release, then
#   sha256sum cv.de.json cv.en.json
# and set all three values together in one commit. A cv release does not reach
# the site before that and a rebuild.
#
# All three are empty until the cv repository has published its first release,
# so a build fails loudly until they are set.
CV_RELEASE_TAG=
CV_RELEASE_SHA256_DE=
CV_RELEASE_SHA256_EN=
